Can I change my color?|Yes, switch between Navy and Black anytime before shipping by replying to your order email.
How does the invite reward work?|Share your personal link. Each friend who reserves and completes their purchase takes $10 off your balance, up to 3 friends ($30).
What if my tier sells out during checkout?|Your price is locked when your $5 deposit goes through. If the tier fills before that, you'll see the next tier's price before you pay.
What's covered by the warranty?|Defects in materials and workmanship for 1 year from delivery. We repair or replace the earbuds.
What if my order arrives damaged?|Contact us and we'll send a replacement or issue a full refund, your choice.
How do returns work?|You have 30 days from delivery to return your earbuds for a full refund, with free return shipping.
Do they work with iPhone and Android?|Yes. They connect to any Bluetooth device, including iPhone, Android, tablets and laptops.
Will they stay in during workouts?|Yes. The ergonomic shape sits securely in the ear, and IPX5 protects against sweat and splashes.
Will Artix Pro be on Amazon?|Yes, after launch at {{ launch_money }}. Presale prices are available only on this site, only during presale.
          {%- endcapture -%}
          {%- assign rows = faq | strip | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
          {%- for row in rows -%}
            {%- assign qa = row | strip | split: '|' -%}
            <details class="ax-faq__item" name="ax-faq">
              <summary><span>{{ qa[0] }}</span>{%- render 'artix-icon', name: 'plus' -%}</summary>
              <p>{{ qa[1] }}</p>
            </details>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {%- comment -%} 12. Final CTA {%- endcomment -%}
    <section class="ax-final" aria-labelledby="ax-final-title">
      <div class="ax-wrap ax-final__inner">
        <h2 id="ax-final-title" class="ax-h2" data-final-title>
          {%- if open_v -%}Only {{ open_rem }} pairs left at {{ open_v.price | money }}.{%- else -%}Presale is sold out.{%- endif -%}
        </h2>
        <p data-final-sub>{% if open_v %}Reserve now for $5. Fully refundable, ships {{ ship }}.{% else %}Artix Pro launches at {{ launch_money }}.{% endif %}</p>
        <button class="ax-btn ax-btn--amber" type="button" data-reserve="final" {% unless open_v %}disabled{% endunless %}>Reserve for $5</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  {%- comment -%} 13. Footer {%- endcomment -%}
  <footer class="ax-footer">
    <div class="ax-wrap">
      <div class="ax-footer__row">
        <span class="ax-wordmark">artix</span>
        <ul class="ax-footer__links">
          <li><a href="{{ s.url_presale_terms | default: '/pages/presale-terms' }}">Presale terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ s.url_referral_terms | default: '/pages/referral-terms' }}">Referral terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ s.url_warranty | default: '/pages/warranty' }}">Warranty</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ s.url_returns | default: '/policies/refund-policy' }}">Returns</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ s.url_shipping | default: '/policies/shipping-policy' }}">Shipping</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ s.url_privacy | default: '/policies/privacy-policy' }}">Privacy</a></li>
          <li><a href="{{ s.url_contact | default: '/pages/contact' }}">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p class="ax-fine">Presale terms: a $5 refundable deposit reserves one pair at the tier price shown at checkout. The remaining balance is charged when your order ships. Shipping starts {{ ship }}. If we cannot ship as promised, we will notify you and you may cancel for a full refund. Noise reduction and battery figures are measured under laboratory conditions; actual results vary with volume, environment and usage.</p>
      <p class="ax-fine">© {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }} {{ shop.name }}</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  {%- comment -%} Config for artix-presale.js. Live values are refreshed from the artix-inventory section. {%- endcomment -%}
  <script type="application/json" data-artix-config>
  {
    "handle": {{ p.handle | json }},
    "launch": {{ launch }},
    "shipDate": {{ ship | json }},
    "currency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | default: 'USD' | json }},
    "pollSeconds": {{ s.poll_seconds | default: 30 }},
    "metaPixelId": {{ s.meta_pixel_id | strip | json }},
    "ga4Id": {{ s.ga4_id | strip | json }},
    "tiers": [
      {%- if p != blank -%}
      {%- for v in p.variants limit: 3 -%}
        {%- assign k = 'tier_' | append: forloop.index | append: '_capacity' -%}
        {%- assign nk = 'tier_' | append: forloop.index | append: '_name' -%}
        {"n": {{ forloop.index }}, "name": {{ s[nk] | json }}, "id": {{ v.id }}, "plan": {{ v.selling_plan_allocations.first.selling_plan.id | json }}, "price": {{ v.price }}, "cap": {{ s[k] | default: 0 }}, "q": {{ v.inventory_quantity | at_least: 0 }}, "a": {{ v.available | json }}}{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    ]
  }
  </script>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Artix presale",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "ax-section-root",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Offer" },
    { "type": "product", "id": "product", "label": "Presale product", "info": "One product with three variants in tier order (Tier 1, 2, 3). Each variant tracks its own inventory and has the pre-order selling plan." },
    { "type": "number", "id": "launch_price_cents", "label": "Launch price in cents", "default": 14999 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ship_date", "label": "Ship date text", "default": "December 15" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tier_1_name", "label": "Tier 1 name", "default": "Early Bird" },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier_1_capacity", "label": "Tier 1 total units", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tier_2_name", "label": "Tier 2 name", "default": "Presale" },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier_2_capacity", "label": "Tier 2 total units", "default": 300 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tier_3_name", "label": "Tier 3 name", "default": "Last Call" },
    { "type": "number", "id": "tier_3_capacity", "label": "Tier 3 total units", "default": 600 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "poll_seconds", "label": "Inventory refresh interval", "min": 15, "max": 120, "step": 5, "unit": "s", "default": 30 },
    { "type": "text", "id": "compare_heading", "label": "Comparison heading", "default": "Flagship features. Half the price of AirPods Pro 3." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Images (light or white backgrounds only)" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "hero_navy", "label": "Hero: Navy open case" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "hero_black", "label": "Hero: Black open case" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "pair_navy", "label": "Features: Navy pair of earbuds" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "pair_black", "label": "Features: Black pair of earbuds" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "closed_navy", "label": "Gift: Navy closed case" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "closed_black", "label": "Gift: Black closed case" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Tracking" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "meta_pixel_id", "label": "Meta Pixel ID", "info": "Leave empty if the Facebook & Instagram sales channel already runs your pixel, to avoid double counting." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ga4_id", "label": "GA4 measurement ID (G-XXXX)", "info": "Leave empty if Google & YouTube or GTM already loads GA4. Events are always pushed to window.dataLayer." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Footer links" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "url_presale_terms", "label": "Presale terms URL", "default": "/pages/presale-terms" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "url_referral_terms", "label": "Referral terms URL", "default": "/pages/referral-terms" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "url_warranty", "label": "Warranty URL", "default": "/pages/warranty" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "url_returns", "label": "Returns URL", "default": "/policies/refund-policy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "url_shipping", "label": "Shipping URL", "default": "/policies/shipping-policy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "url_privacy", "label": "Privacy URL", "default": "/policies/privacy-policy" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "url_contact", "label": "Contact URL", "default": "/pages/contact" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "gallery_image",
      "name": "Gallery image",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "alt", "label": "Alt text", "default": "Artix Pro earbuds" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 8
}
{% endschema %}
